  "decision_conditions": [
    "This consent is valid for two years.\rReason: In order that the nature of work pertaining to this consent remains appropriate.",
    "This Notice in no way overrides the right of the owner of the land upon which the subject tree is located to refuse to allow the works hereby approved, or deny access to their property or airspace above it to facilitate the works. The relevant consents must first be obtained by the land owner prior to the commencement of any works.\rReason: To ensure the appropriate permissions are obtained where work is proposed upon trees not under the applicant's ownership.",
    "The works hereby approved shall only be carried out strictly in accordance with British Standard 3998 [2010] 'Tree Works'.\rReason: In the interests of the health, safety and appearance of the preserved tree[s].",
    "Tree work should not be carried out during periods that are likely to interfere with or disturb breeding birds or mammals.\rReason: In order to comply with the requirements of the Wildlife and Countryside Act (1981) and Conservation of Habitats and Species Regulations (2010)."
